re possible; but since it's not, we can still review. But the key blocking issue is staleness. Let me load the review skills to comply, and do a review anyway for thoroughness.\n\nActually, let me think about the merge-base. The prompt says \"review the diff from origin/${FOREST_PRIMARY_REF#refs/heads/} to that exact SHA for correctness...\" So I need to review `git diff origin/master..f1256ae`. Let me get the full diff.\n\nLet me read the review skills first."}}
